   ############ ACCOUNTS ############

### 1. Create an account
POST http://localhost:3000/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "DocProcessor", "plan": "Starter" }

### Paste the api_key from the response of request 1 here
@key = mk_lELUc4xfsfRvE9hmUqAcP9l-35OAvXmQ

### 2. Who am I?
GET http://localhost:3000/me
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 3. No key
GET http://localhost:3000/me

### 4. Wrong key
GET http://localhost:3000/me
x-api-key: mk_wrong

### 5. Unknown plan
POST http://localhost:3000/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test", "plan": "Basic" }

   ############ USERS ############

### 6. Create user alice (default plan Basic)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "external_id": "alice" }

### 7. Create user bob on Premium
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "external_id": "bob", "plan": "Premium" }

### 8. Create alice again → 409
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "external_id": "alice" }

### 9. Give a user an account plan → 400
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "external_id": "carol", "plan": "Starter" }

### 10. Get alice
GET http://localhost:3000/users/alice
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 11. Switch alice to Premium
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/alice/plan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "plan": "Premium" }

### 12. Unknown user → 404
GET http://localhost:3000/users/zack
x-api-key: {{key}}


   ############ PLANS ############

### 13. List all plans
GET http://localhost:3000/plans
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 14. List only user plans
GET http://localhost:3000/plans?scope=user
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 15. Create custom user plan Gold (copy its "id" from the response)
POST http://localhost:3000/plans
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "name": "Gold", "scope": "user", "monthly_allowance": 2000, "max_units_per_request": 50 }

### Paste Gold's id here
@goldId = 44b98aaa-f45b-409f-b9f0-c5adfcaeb2bb

### 16. Get Gold
GET http://localhost:3000/plans/{{goldId}}
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 17. Edit Gold's allowance
PATCH http://localhost:3000/plans/{{goldId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "monthly_allowance": 3000 }

### 18. Put a user on Gold
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "external_id": "dana", "plan": "Gold" }

### 19. Invalid numbers → 400
POST http://localhost:3000/plans
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "name": "Bad", "scope": "user", "monthly_allowance": 1.5, "max_units_per_request": 0 }

### 20. Switch the account to Pro
PUT http://localhost:3000/me/plan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "plan": "Pro" }


### 21. List only account plans
GET http://localhost:3000/plans?scope=account
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 22. Create a custom account plan
POST http://localhost:3000/plans
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "name": "Enterprise", "scope": "account", "monthly_allowance": 500000, "max_units_per_request": 5000 }

### 23. Switch the account to the custom plan
PUT http://localhost:3000/me/plan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "plan": "Enterprise" }

### 24. Check the account's plan
GET http://localhost:3000/me
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 25. Give the account a user plan → 400
PUT http://localhost:3000/me/plan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "plan": "Basic" }

############ CONSUME ############

### 26. Accepted: alice asks for 10 (her plan allows 20 per request)
POST http://localhost:3000/consume
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "user_id": "alice", "units": 10, "request_id": "demo-1" }

### 27. Retry the same request_id → same answer, "replayed": true, not counted again
POST http://localhost:3000/consume
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "user_id": "alice", "units": 10, "request_id": "demo-1" }

### 28. Same request_id, different units → 409
POST http://localhost:3000/consume
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "user_id": "alice", "units": 11, "request_id": "demo-1" }

### 29. Rejected by user's per-request limit: create a user on Basic (max 20), ask for 25
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "external_id": "eve", "plan": "Basic" }

###
POST http://localhost:3000/consume
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "user_id": "eve", "units": 25, "request_id": "demo-2" }

### 30. Rejected by the account's monthly limit:
### create a tiny account plan, switch to it, then ask for more than is left
POST http://localhost:3000/plans
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "name": "Tiny", "scope": "account", "monthly_allowance": 5, "max_units_per_request": 100 }

###
PUT http://localhost:3000/me/plan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "plan": "Tiny" }

###
POST http://localhost:3000/consume
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "user_id": "eve", "units": 10, "request_id": "demo-3" }

### 31. Switch the account back to Pro so later tests work
PUT http://localhost:3000/me/plan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "plan": "Pro" }

### 32. Unknown user → 404
POST http://localhost:3000/consume
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "user_id": "zack", "units": 1, "request_id": "demo-4" }

############ USAGE & HISTORY ############

### 33. Usage this month: account + all users
GET http://localhost:3000/usage
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 34. Usage for a past month (only "used")
GET http://localhost:3000/usage?month=2026-09
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 35. One user's usage this month
GET http://localhost:3000/users/alice/usage
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 36. Account request history, 3 per page (copy next_cursor for the next page)
GET http://localhost:3000/requests?limit=3
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 37. Next page (paste the next_cursor from 36)
GET http://localhost:3000/requests?limit=3&cursor=PASTE_NEXT_CURSOR
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 38. One user's request history
GET http://localhost:3000/users/eve/requests
x-api-key: {{key}}

### 39. Invalid month → 400
GET http://localhost:3000/usage?month=2026-13
x-api-key: {{key}}